{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:00 2026-06-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:00 2026-06-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:00 2026-06-20 HKT</p><p>今日（20日）下午2時06分，3名男女到大埔滘自然護理區行山郊遊，其間他們沿啡徑而行，惟其中1對分別26及27歲的男女，報稱被蜂群螫傷，分別頭痛及眼痛，幸仍然清醒。救護員接報到場為他們治療後，再將二人送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><img alt=\"一名女子報稱眼部受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d4e6718339c0b19daabe2bb5093ad2b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_10_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"同行的一名男子亦報稱頭痛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5033ca42141ee55d5883d9d577146565/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_10_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"救護車將兩名傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7cd420956bcf94b2f617f0814a8bc9e4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_10_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為大埔滘自然護理區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a46795e83c75b80006de6e2a99db9630/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_10_36_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d0fc9623298c72bf4112111200015a3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-20_at_16_10_36.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-20T13:58:14.525226+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}